{"id":"torrey:providence-of-god-the","source":"torrey","name":"Providence Of God, The","slug":"providence-of-god-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Is his care over his works — Ps 145:9.","refs":[["Ps",145,9,145,9]]},{"text":"Preserving his creatures. — Ne 9:6; Ps 36:6; Mt 10:29.","refs":[["Neh",9,6,9,6],["Ps",36,6,36,6],["Matt",10,29,10,29]]},{"text":"Providing for his creatures. — Ps 104:27,28; 136:25; 147:9; Mt 6:26.","refs":[["Ps",104,27,104,27],["Ps",104,28,104,28],["Ps",136,25,136,25],["Ps",147,9,147,9],["Matt",6,26,6,26]]},{"text":"The special preservation of saints. — Ps 37:28; 91:11; Mt 10:30.","refs":[["Ps",37,28,37,28],["Ps",91,11,91,11],["Matt",10,30,10,30]]},{"text":"Prospering saints. — Ge 24:48,56.","refs":[["Gen",24,48,24,48],["Gen",24,56,24,56]]},{"text":"Protecting saints. — Ps 91:4; 140:7.","refs":[["Ps",91,4,91,4],["Ps",140,7,140,7]]},{"text":"Delivering saints. — Ps 91:3; Isa 31:5.","refs":[["Ps",91,3,91,3],["Isa",31,5,31,5]]},{"text":"Leading saints. — De 8:2,15; Isa 31:5.","refs":[["Deut",8,2,8,2],["Deut",8,15,8,15],["Isa",31,5,31,5]]},{"text":"Leading saints. — De 8:2,15; Isa 63:12.","refs":[["Deut",8,2,8,2],["Deut",8,15,8,15],["Isa",63,12,63,12]]},{"text":"Bringing His words to pass. — Nu 26:65; Jos 21:45; Lu 21:32,33.","refs":[["Num",26,65,26,65],["Josh",21,45,21,45],["Luke",21,32,21,32],["Luke",21,33,21,33]]},{"text":"Ordering the ways of men. — Pr 16:9; 19:21; 20:24.","refs":[["Prov",16,9,16,9],["Prov",19,21,19,21],["Prov",20,24,20,24]]},{"text":"Ordaining the conditions and circumstances of men. — 1Sa 2:7,8; Ps 75:6,7.","refs":[["1Sam",2,7,2,7],["1Sam",2,8,2,8],["Ps",75,6,75,6],["Ps",75,7,75,7]]},{"text":"Determining the period of human life. — Ps 31:15; 39:5; Ac 17:26.","refs":[["Ps",31,15,31,15],["Ps",39,5,39,5],["Acts",17,26,17,26]]},{"text":"Defeating wicked designs. — Ex 15:9-19; 2Sa 17:14,15; Ps 33:10.","refs":[["Exod",15,9,15,19],["2Sam",17,14,17,14],["2Sam",17,15,17,15],["Ps",33,10,33,10]]},{"text":"Overruling wicked designs for good. — Ge 45:5-7; 50:20; Php 1:12.","refs":[["Gen",45,5,45,7],["Gen",50,20,50,20],["Phil",1,12,1,12]]},{"text":"Preserving the course of nature. — Ge 8:22; Job 26:10; Ps 104:5-9.","refs":[["Gen",8,22,8,22],["Job",26,10,26,10],["Ps",104,5,104,9]]},{"text":"Directing all events. — Jos 7:14; 1Sa 6:7-10,12; Pr 16:33; Isa 44:7; Ac 1:26.","refs":[["Josh",7,14,7,14],["1Sam",6,7,6,10],["1Sam",6,12,6,12],["Prov",16,33,16,33],["Isa",44,7,44,7],["Acts",1,26,1,26]]},{"text":"Ruling the elements. — Job 37:9-13; Isa 50:2; Joh 1:4,15; Na 1:4.","refs":[["Job",37,9,37,13],["Isa",50,2,50,2],["John",1,4,1,4],["John",1,15,1,15],["Nah",1,4,1,4]]},{"text":"Ordering the minutest matters. — Mt 10:29,30; Lu 21:18.","refs":[["Matt",10,29,10,29],["Matt",10,30,10,30],["Luke",21,18,21,18]]},{"text":"Is righteous — Ps 145:17; Da 4:37.","refs":[["Ps",145,17,145,17],["Dan",4,37,4,37]]},{"text":"Is ever watchful — Ps 121:4; Isa 27:3.","refs":[["Ps",121,4,121,4],["Isa",27,3,27,3]]},{"text":"Is all pervading — Ps 139:1-5.","refs":[["Ps",139,1,139,5]]},{"text":"Sometimes dark and mysterious — Ps 36:6; 73:16; 77:19; Ro 11:33.","refs":[["Ps",36,6,36,6],["Ps",73,16,73,16],["Ps",77,19,77,19],["Rom",11,33,11,33]]},{"text":"For his glory. — Isa 63:14.","refs":[["Isa",63,14,63,14]]},{"text":"For good to saints. — Ro 8:28.","refs":[["Rom",8,28,8,28]]},{"text":"The wicked made to promote the designs — Isa 10:5-12; Ac 3:17,18.","refs":[["Isa",10,5,10,12],["Acts",3,17,3,17],["Acts",3,18,3,18]]},{"text":"In prosperity. — De 8:18; 1Ch 29:12.","refs":[["Deut",8,18,8,18],["1Chr",29,12,29,12]]},{"text":"In adversity. — Job 1:21; Ps 119:15.","refs":[["Job",1,21,1,21],["Ps",119,15,119,15]]},{"text":"In public calamities. — Am 3:6.","refs":[["Amos",3,6,3,6]]},{"text":"In our daily support. — Ge 48:15.","refs":[["Gen",48,15,48,15]]},{"text":"In all things. — Pr 3:6.","refs":[["Prov",3,6,3,6]]},{"text":"Cannot be defeated — 1Ki 22:30,34; Pr 21:30.","refs":[["1Kgs",22,30,22,30],["1Kgs",22,34,22,34],["Prov",21,30,21,30]]},{"text":"Man’s efforts are vain without — Ps 127:1,2; Pr 21:31.","refs":[["Ps",127,1,127,1],["Ps",127,2,127,2],["Prov",21,31,21,31]]},{"text":"Trust in. — Mt 6:33,34; 10:9,29-31.","refs":[["Matt",6,33,6,33],["Matt",6,34,6,34],["Matt",10,9,10,9],["Matt",10,29,10,31]]},{"text":"Have full confidence in. — Ps 16:8; 139:10.","refs":[["Ps",16,8,16,8],["Ps",139,10,139,10]]},{"text":"Commit their works to. — Pr 16:3.","refs":[["Prov",16,3,16,3]]},{"text":"Encourage themselves. — 1Sa 30:6.","refs":[["1Sam",30,6,30,6]]},{"text":"Pray in dependence upon. — Ac 12:5.","refs":[["Acts",12,5,12,5]]},{"text":"Pray to be guided by. — Ge 24:12-14; 28:20,21; Ac 1:24.","refs":[["Gen",24,12,24,14],["Gen",28,20,28,20],["Gen",28,21,28,21],["Acts",1,24,1,24]]},{"text":"Result of depending upon — Lu 22:35.","refs":[["Luke",22,35,22,35]]},{"text":"Connected with the use of means — 1Ki 21:19; 22:37,38; Mic 5:2; Lu 2:1-4; Ac 27:22,31,32.","refs":[["1Kgs",21,19,21,19],["1Kgs",22,37,22,37],["1Kgs",22,38,22,38],["Mic",5,2,5,2],["Luke",2,1,2,4],["Acts",27,22,27,22],["Acts",27,31,27,31],["Acts",27,32,27,32]]},{"text":"Danger of denying — Isa 10:13-17; Eze 28:2-10; Da 4:29-31; Ho 2:8,9.","refs":[["Isa",10,13,10,17],["Ezek",28,2,28,10],["Dan",4,29,4,31],["Hos",2,8,2,8],["Hos",2,9,2,9]]}],"refCount":116}
